#: ../../administration/administration.rst:3
msgid "Administration"
msgstr "Administración"

#: ../../administration/administration.rst:5
msgid ""
"There are several administrative integrations built into |morpheus| that "
"make it great to work with within any organization ranging from small to "
"large. Especially, with its built in white label support and multitenancy "
"capabilities, managed service providers have a wide range of capabilities "
"when it comes to managing customer accounts and users."
msgstr ""
"There son several administrative integraciones built en |morpheus| ese make "
"ello great a work con dentro de cualquier organization ranging desde small a"
" large. Especially, con su built en white label soporte y multitenancy "
"capabilities, gestionado service providers tienen a wide range de "
"capabilities cuando ello comes a managing customer cuentas y usuarios."
